
  strapd installer

  Install to this machine:      strapd-install

  Wi-Fi first, if you need it:  iwctl
                                  station wlan0 scan
                                  station wlan0 get-networks
                                  station wlan0 connect YOUR-SSID
                                  exit

  The installer erases the disk you choose. It asks everything up front
  and confirms the disk by name before it writes anything.

